d><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 8%;padding: 0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><strong>337,3</strong></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 10%;padding: 0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><strong>337,3</strong></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 11%;padding: 0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12%;padding: 0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="CHANGES_ORIGINS"><label id="s1104"></label><div name="8325294" id="8325294">(1-илова Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2026 йил 6 июлдаги ПФ-123-сонли <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/8309048?ONDATE=06.07.2026 00#8313262">Фармони </a>таҳририда — Қонунчилик маълумотлари миллий базаси, 06.07.2026 й., 06/26/123/0692-сон)</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8103048" id="8103048"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="8103049" id="8103049">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2026 йил 25 мартдаги ПФ-47-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/8101199">Фармонига</a><br />2-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="8103050" id="8103050">Ботаника ва дендрология боғларини ташкил этишнинг</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="8103051" id="8103051">АСОСИЙ ВАЗИФАЛАРИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8103052" id="8103052"></div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103053" id="8103053">1. Бошқа минтақа ва хорижий мамлакатлардан янги дарахт, бута ва кам учрайдиган ўсимлик турларини олиб кириш (интродукция) ва маҳаллий иқлимга мослаштириш (акклиматизация).</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103054" id="8103054">2. Дарахт турларининг генофондини сақлаш, йўқолган популяцияларни тиклаш, кам учрайдиган, йўқолиб бораётган, эндемик ва Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қизил китобига киритилган дарахт турларининг тирик коллекцияларини яратиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103055" id="8103055">3. Ҳудудларда «ин-витро» лабораторияларини ташкил этиш ва кўчатчиликка бўлган талабни тўлиқ қондириш, селекция билан шуғулланиш, янги ўсимлик навларини яратиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103056" id="8103056">4. Ўзбекистон Фанлар академияси билан биргаликда ботаника ва дендрология боғларини замонавий услубда ташкил этиш ва улар ҳудудида экотизимга мос ҳайвонот дунёси объектлари (қушлар, олмахон ва бошқалар)ни табиий кўпайтириш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103057" id="8103057">5. Ўсимликларнинг морфологияси, фенологияси ва физиологиясини ўрганиш бўйича тадқиқотлар ўтказиш, талабалар ва мактаб ўқувчилари учун амалиёт ва илмий-тажриба участкаларини ташкил қилиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103058" id="8103058">6. Аҳоли ўртасида экологик маданиятни ошириш ҳамда табиатни муҳофаза қилиш, дарахт экиш ва яшил майдонларга ғамхўрлик қилишга оид тадбирларни ташкил этиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103059" id="8103059">7. Аҳолининг дам олиши ва саломатлигини тиклаши учун қулай шароитлар яратиш, ташриф буюриш учун инфратузилмани ривожлантириш (йўлакчалар, ўриндиқлар, дам олиш ва пикник ҳудудлари, югуриш йўлаклари, очиқ осмон остидаги кутубхона, бепул «Wi-Fi» ҳудудлари ва бошқалар).</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8103060" id="8103060"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="8103061" id="8103061">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2026 йил 25 мартдаги ПФ-47-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/8101199">Фармонига</a><br />3-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="8103062" id="8103062">«Яшиллик элчи»ларининг</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="8103063" id="8103063">АСОСИЙ ВАЗИФАЛАРИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8103064" id="8103064"></div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103065" id="8103065">1. Ботаника ва дендрология боғларидаги яшил ҳудудларнинг ҳолатини мунтазам мониторинг қилиш, аниқланган камчилик ва муаммолар тўғрисида масъул давлат органига маълумот тақдим этиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103066" id="8103066">2. Ботаника ва дендрология боғларида амалга оширилаётган кўкаламзорлаштириш, парваришлаш ва экологик тадбирларда фаол иштирок этиш, аҳоли, хусусан, ёшлар ўртасида экологик маданиятни ошириш бўйича ташаббусларни илгари суриш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103067" id="8103067">3. Ботаника ва дендрология боғларида ўтказиладиган экологик акциялар, маърифий ва маданий тадбирларни ташкил этишда ёрдам кўрсатиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103068" id="8103068">4. Ботаника ва дендрология боғларини сақлаш ва ривожлантириш бўйича маҳаллий ҳамда халқаро грантлар, ҳомийлик маблағлари ва ижтимоий шериклик лойиҳаларини жалб этишга кўмаклашиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103069" id="8103069">5. Давлат органлари ва маҳаллий ижро ҳокимият органлари билан ҳамкорликда Ботаника ва дендрология боғларининг экологик ва эстетик ҳолатини яхшилаш бўйича таклифлар ишлаб чиқиш.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8103070" id="8103070"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="8103071" id="8103071">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2026 йил 25 мартдаги ПФ-47-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/8101199">Фармонига</a><br />4-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="8103072" id="8103072">«Яшил боғларни бошқариш ўрмон илмий-тажриба маркази» давлат муассасасининг асосий вазифалари ва функциялари ҳамда фаолиятининг устувор йўналишлари</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8103073" id="8103073"></div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103074" id="8103074">«Яшил боғларни бошқариш ўрмон илмий-тажриба маркази» давлат муассасасининг асосий вазифалари ва функциялари ҳамда фаолиятининг устувор йўналишлари қуйидагилардан иборат:</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103077" id="8103077">(а) ўзига бириктирилган ботаника, дендрология ва яшил боғлар (кейинги ўринларда — боғлар) ҳудудидаги дарахт, бута ва бошқа ўсимлик дунёси объектларини асраш, сақлаб қолиш, қайта тиклаш, такрор кўпайтириш ва ундан оқилона фойдаланишга қаратилган тадбирларни амалга ошириш;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103080" id="8103080">(б) аҳолининг сайр қилиши, табиат билан уйғунлашган ҳолда очиқ ҳавода ҳордиқ чиқариши учун атроф-муҳит софлигини сақлаш ва яшилликни кўпайтириш бўйича зарур шароитлар яратиш;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103081" id="8103081">(в) боғларда сув тежайдиган технологияларни қўллаган ҳолда суғориш ишларини ўз вақтида ташкил этиш;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103082" id="8103082">(г) касалланган ёки зарарланган дарахт ва буталардаги зарарли таъсирларни ҳамда уларнинг келиб чиқиш омилларини ўрганиш;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103084" id="8103084">(д) дарахт-буталарда аниқланган касаллик ва зараркунандаларга қарши механик, биологик ҳамда кимёвий усуллар асосида курашиш;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103085" id="8103085">(ж) дарахтлар, буталар ва ўсимлик дунёсига мансуб бошқа ўсимлик турларининг уруғларини йиғиш, ниҳол ва кўчат етиштириш ҳамда уларни парваришлаш;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103086" id="8103086">(з) уруғчилик ва кўчатчиликни ривожлантириш бўйича илғор давлатлар тажрибасини ўрганиш, уларнинг натижаларини амалиётга татбиқ этиш;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103088" id="8103088">(и) боғларни самарали бошқариш, сақлаш ҳамда ривожлантириш йўналишида олий таълим ва илмий ташкилотлар билан ҳамкорликда тадқиқотлар олиб бориш;</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103090" id="8103090">(к) боғлардаги дарахт ва буталар шохлари туташгунга қадар уларнинг қатор ораларидан самарали фойдаланишни ташкил этиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8103091" id="8103091">Бунда уларнинг қатор ораларида манзарали дарахт ва бута, бир йиллик ва кўп йиллик гул кўчатларини етиштиришга рухсат берилади.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8103094" id="8103094"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="8103096" id="8103096">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2026 йил 25 мартдаги ПФ-47-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/8101199">Фармонига</a><br />5-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="8103097" id="8103097">Ҳудудларда ботаника ва дендрология боғларини ташкил қилиш, яшиллик даражасини ошириш ҳамда мавжуд яшил боғларни асраб қолиш бўйича</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="8103098" id="8103098">ЧОРА-ТАДБИРЛАР РЕЖАСИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="8103099" id="8103099"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="8103100" id="8103100"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Т/р</span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Чора-тадбирлар номи</span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижро муддати</span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Молиялаштириш манбалари</span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Масъул ижрочилар</span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">I. </span></b><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Республикада яшил боғларни ташкил қилиш ва парваришлаш тадбирларининг ҳуқуқий асосларини янада такомиллаштириш</span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">1.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2030 йилгача Ўзбекистон Республикасида яшилликни оширишга қаратилган «Яшил мувозанат — барқарор келажак» стратегиясини ишлаб чиқиш. Бунда қуйидагиларни назарда тутиш:</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">аҳоли яшаш пунктларида экологик барқарорликни таъминлаш мақсадида халқаро стандартлар ва илғор тажрибалар асосида «яшил қоплама» миқдорини 30 фоизга етказиш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмон фонди ерларида ўрмон билан қопланган ҳудудлар миқдорини кескин оширишга қаратилган амалий чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш, қайта ўрмон барпо этиш, янги ўрмонзорлар ташкил қилиш ҳамда мавжудларини тиклаш учун илғор технологиялардан фойдаланиш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">чўл ҳудудларида «яшил қоплама»лар миқдорини ошириш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">аҳоли ва тадбиркорлик субъектларини дарахт кўчатларини экиш тадбирларига кенг жалб қилиш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">яшиллик даражасини оширишга ўз ҳиссасини қўшаётган жисмоний ва юридик шахсларни давлат томонидан қўллаб-қувватлаш механизмларини жорий қилиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил март</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ишлаб чиқиш учун</span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> — маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ташкил қилиш учун</span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> — Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси, ҳомийлик ва хайрия маблағлари</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Транспорт вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бош прокуратура,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Яшил боғларни бошқариш ўрмон илмий-тажриба маркази» давлат муассасаси ва унинг филиалларини ташкил қилиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">муассаса ва унинг филиаллари штат жадвали, техник ва ёрдамчи ходимлар сони, улар меҳнатига ҳақ тўлаш тартибини ҳамда фаолиятининг устувор вазифаларини назарда тутувчи ташкилот низомини тасдиқлаш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Икки ой муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">3.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Яшил боғларни бошқариш ўрмон илмий-тажриба маркази» давлат муассасаси таркибида алоҳида юридик шахс ташкил этмаган ҳолда ҳудудлардаги мавжуд дарахт ва буталарнинг касаллик, зараркунандаларга қарши курашиш тизимини яратиш мақсадида <b>Дарахт касалликлари ва зараркунандаларига қарши курашиш хизматини</b> ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Яшил қоплама»лар ва яшиллик барпо этилган ҳудудларда ўсимликларнинг касаллик ва зараркунандалари келиб чиқиши ва тарқалишини ўрганиш бўйича идоралараро ишчи гуруҳ тузиб, экспедиция ташкил этиш ҳамда мавжуд муаммоларни бартараф қилиш юзасидан тегишли таклифларни мувофиқлаштириш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ишчи гуруҳ ташкил этилгандан сўнг доимий равишда муаммоларни ўрганиб боради</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Дарахт касалликлари ва зараркунандаларига қарши курашиш хизмати</span></b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> томонидан <b>2027-2028 йиллар</b> давомида ўрмонларнинг фитосанитар ҳолатини илмий асосда ўрганиш, ўрмонларнинг ҳолатини яхшилаш учун касалланган ва зарарланган ўрмонзорларда ўз вақтида касаллик ва зараркунандаларга қарши кимёвий курашиш, биологик </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">препаратларни</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">, шунингдек, стресс омилларнинг салбий таъсирини камайтирувчи биостимуляторларни қўллаш, Оролнинг қуриган туби ва оролбўйи ҳудудларида барпо этилган «яшил қоплама»ларда учраётган касаллик ва зараркунандаларнинг келиб чиқиши ҳамда тарқалишини ўрганиш, унга қарши курашиш бўйича амалга ошириладиган чора-тадбирлар дастури лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил 1 октябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Чора-тадбирлар дастури лойиҳасини тасдиқлаш мақсадида Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти Администрациясига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил 25 декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">4.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Давлат таълим ташкилотлари (мактаб, академик лицей, техникум, олий таълим муассасаси ва бошқалар) ва соғлиқни сақлаш ташкилотлари (поликлиника, тиббиёт муассасалари, шифохоналар) ҳамда хавфлилик даражаси I ва II тоифага мансуб корхоналар бошқа жойга кўчирилган тақдирда, улар ўрнида яшил жамоат паркларини ташкил қилишни назарда тутувчи норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш. Бунда: </span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">объектлар бошқа жойга кўчирилган тақдирда, ушбу муассасанинг балансида бўлган ер майдонини белгиланган тартибда инвентаризациядан ўтказиш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">мазкур ер майдонидаги мавжуд объектлар (иншоотлар, қурилмалар)нинг ҳуқуқий ва техник ҳолати юзасидан баҳолаш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">объектларни яшил жамоат паркларини ташкил қилиш учун Экология қўмитаси тасарруфига беғараз ўтказиш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси томонидан мазкур ер майдонларини яшил жамоат парки барпо этиш учун тадбиркорлик субъектларига, шу жумладан, давлат-хусусий шериклик механизмлари асосида ижарага бериш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ижара шартининг бир қисми сифатида ер майдонидан фойдаланишда белгиланган мақсаддан четга чиқмаслик, яшил ҳудудларни барпо қилиш ва сақлаш, жамоатчилик учун очиқ ва бепул фойдаланиш имкониятини таъминлаш шартларини қатъий белгилаб қўйиш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Давлат активларини бошқариш агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Мактабгача ва мактаб таълими вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">5.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Аҳолининг барча қатламларининг ҳаёти давомида дарахт </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">экиш</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> ва парваришлашга қўшган ҳиссасини ҳисобга олиш ва рағбатлантириб боришни назарда тутувчи «яшил балл» (green points) тизимини жорий этиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Адлия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Марказий банк</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">(а) хорижий давлатлар тажрибасини ўрганиш, айниқса, Хитой, Туркия, Германия, Жанубий Корея, Ҳиндистон каби давлатларнинг бу борада амалга оширган лойиҳалари натижадорлигига эътибор қаратиш;</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:0cm"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">(б) норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш, унда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">аҳолининг дарахт экиш ва парваришлаш билан боғлиқ фаолиятини онлайн ҳисобга олиш ва «яшил балл» бериш тартиби;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Smart-foresty» мобил иловаси ва GIS харитасида дарахт экиш мумкин бўлган майдон хариталарини белгилаш тизими;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">дарахт экиш бўйича якка тартибда ёки жамоавий иштирок этиш ёки экиш ва парваришлаш тадбирлари учун буюртма бериш тартиби;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">экилган ҳар бир дарахтга уникал QR код ва электрон паспорт бериш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">жамғарилган «яшил бал»ларни:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">коммунал тўловлари, солиқ, давлат хизматлари учун чегирма сифатида қўллаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">олийгоҳларга кириш ёки ўқишни тамомлашда «яшил рейтинг» орқали имтиёзлар олиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ҳар йилги танловларда энг юқори балл тўплаган фуқароларни тақдирлаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">тўпланган балларни монетизация қилиш ва бошқа рағбатлантириш; </span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">фарзанд туғилганида ота-она, васий ёки яқин қариндошлар бола номига дарахт экиш учун ихтиёрий буюртма </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">бериш</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> ва туғилган болага илк «яшил балл» белгилаш механизмларини назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:0cm"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил январь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Мавжуд дастурий платформалар, шу жумладан, «Smart-foresty» мобил иловасини такомиллаштириш ва маълумот манбалари билан интеграция қилиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:0cm"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тизим тажриба-синов тариқасида Самарқанд вилояти ва Тошкент вилоятида жорий этилиб, натижалари бўйича Вазирлар Маҳкамасига ахборот киритиш. </span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Синов якунлари асосида амалиёт республика бўйлаб босқичма-босқич татбиқ этилади.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:0cm"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил январь — июнь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">6.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўзбекистонда ерлар деградациясига қарши курашишни назарда тутувчи 2026 — 2030 йилларга мўлжалланган миллий дастур лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кадастр агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">7.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Жисмоний ёки юридик шахс камида мингта дарахт ва бута кўчатлардан иборат яшил боғ ва яшил жамоат паркини ташкил этса ёхуд Яшил хайрия жамғармасига камида 200 миллион сўм ҳадя қилса, «Экоҳамкор» мақомини беришни назарда тутувчи норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ушбу жисмоний ёки юридик шахсларга ёхуд унинг таъсисчисига ўз номини тамғалаш; </span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">жисмоний ёки юридик шахсга уларга ушбу мақомдан ўз фаолиятини реклама қилишда фойдаланиш ҳуқуқини бериш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">жисмоний ёки юридик шахс фаолияти билан боғлиқ тадбирларни ўтказишга рухсат бериш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">жисмоний ёки юридик шахсларга юқорида белгиланган ҳуқуқлардан фойдаланишда ҳар қандай қурилиш қилишни тақиқлаш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ушбу амалиётни аҳоли ва тадбиркорлар кенг оммасига етказиш ҳамда республиканинг барча ҳудудларида жорий этиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил май</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">8.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">5 та яшил боғ ва яшил жамоат паркини ўз ҳисобидан барпо </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">қилган</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> шахсларга «Келажак бунёдкори» давлат мукофотини бериш тизимини жорий этиш бўйича таклиф киритиш. </span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил январь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">9.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Яшил </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">чипта</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">» тизимини жорий этиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">самолёт, поезд, метро ва такси йўналишларида маршрутнинг карбон изи (таъсирини) ихтиёрий равишда компенсация қилиш имкони бериш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">компенсациядан тушган маблағларни Яшил хайрия жамғармасига ўтказиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ушбу маблағларни фақат дарахт экиш ва парваришлаш тадбирларига йўналтиришни инобатга олиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси ва грант маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Транспорт вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">10.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Туман ва шаҳарларнинг бош режаларининг ҳамда </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">таълим ва соғлиқни сақлаш ташкилотлари ер майдонларининг </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">камида 30 фоизи кўкаламзорлаштириш ҳудудларига ажратилишини қатъий таъминлаш. </span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бунда қуйидагиларни назарда тутувчи тегишли норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатларга ўзгартириш ва қўшимчалар киритиш:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">лойиҳаланаётган ва амалдаги транспорт йўли четлари ёки </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">йўл</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> ёқаларига дарахтларни белгиланган тартибда экиш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">кўчатлар экиладиган майдонларни аниқлаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">дарахт ва буталар турларини тўғри танлаш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">лойиҳалаш ва йил давомида парваришлаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">таълим ва </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">соғлиқни</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> сақлаш ташкилотлари рўйхати, уларнинг ер майдонлари тўғрисидаги аниқ маълумотларни Экология қўмитасига тақдим қилиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил май</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Мактабгача ва мактаб таълими вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">11.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Яшил майдонлар жозибадорлигини ошириш мақсадида дарахт ва буталарни тўғри парваришлаш учун шакл бериш ҳамда хавфсиз баландликда ишлаш тизимини жорий этиш, шунингдек, дарахтларни тупроқ илдизи билан кўчириш, санитар ҳолатини диагностика қилиш ва мунтазам мониторингини амалга ошириш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Давлат бюджети маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">яшил майдонлар ҳолатини ўрганиш, мавжуд дарахт ва буталарнинг тури, таркиби, ёши ва санитар ҳолатини баҳолаш ҳамда ҳар бир майдон учун парвариш, шакл бериш ва хавфсиз ишлаш бўйича календарь режа ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга ошириш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил 1 июнь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўсимликлар карантини ва ҳимояси агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">баландликда ишловчи ходимлар учун махсус ўқув дастурлари ва сертификатлаштириш тадбирларини амалга ошириш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил сентябрь-октябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Камбағалликни қисқартириш ва бандлик вазирлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">замонавий индивидуал ҳимоя воситалари ҳамда баландликда ишлаш ускуналарини харид қилишни таъминлаш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бандликка кўмаклашиш давлат жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">12.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги ва фермер хўжаликлари ер участкаларининг четларида иҳота дарахтзорлар барпо этиш тартиби ва мажбуриятини белгилаш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">қишлоқ хўжалиги маҳсулотларини етиштириш учун ерни </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ижарага</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> бериш бўйича шартномада иҳота дарахтзорлар барпо этиш мажбуриятини киритиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">шартноманинг ушбу талаби 2 йил давомида </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">бажарилмаган</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> тақдирда, ер ижараси тўғрисидаги шартномани бекор қилиш учун асос бўлишини белгилаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">қишлоқ хўжалиги маҳсулотларини жойлаштириш режасида иҳота дарахтзорларни барпо этиш учун ер участкаси ажратилишини ҳисобга олиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил август</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўзбекистон фермерлари кенгаши,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">13.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Яшил боғ, яшил жамоат парки, «яшил белбоғ», «яшил қоплама», «яшил қалқон», ҳимоя ўрмонзорлари, шунингдек, ботаника, дендрология ва галофит боғлари, полигонлар рекультивацияси, сунъий кўл ва ҳовузлар, шаҳарларнинг яшил мастер режаси ва бошқа экологик лойиҳаларнинг лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатларини ишлаб чиқиш учун жалб қилинадиган «Яшил лойиҳа» лойиҳалаш институтини Ягона етказиб берувчилар реестрига киритиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бир ой муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Саноат кооперацияси ва давлат харидлари агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">14.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Яшил боғларни бошқариш ўрмон илмий-тажриба маркази»</span><b> </b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">давлат муассасаси томонидан Марказий Осиё атроф-муҳит ва иқлим ўзгаришини ўрганиш университети (Green University) ҳудудидаги яшил майдонлар ва унга туташ ҳудудда экспериментал ва ўқув-тажриба мақсадлари учун ташкил этилган дендрология боғи ва «Астрономия» жамоат паркини сақлаш ва парваришлаш ҳамда моддий-техника базасини мустаҳкамлаш ишларини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">доимий</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">15.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Оҳангарон туманида жойлашган «Овжазсой-Мовий тоғлар» миллий табиат боғига олиб борувчи автомобиль йўлларини таъмирлаш ва реконструкция қилиш, йўл бўйи муҳандислик-коммуникация тармоқларини тартибга келтириш, йўл белгилари ва кўрсаткичларини ўрнатиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026-2027 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент вилояти ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Автомобиль йўллари қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">16.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Оҳангарон туманида жойлашган «Овжазсой-Мовий тоғлар» миллий табиат боғида қуйидаги чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">енгил конструкцияли замонавий ташриф марказларини (Visitor center), савдо нуқталари ва экокўргазмасини ёғоч биноларидан ташкил этиш ва уларнинг узлуксиз ҳамда самарали фаолиятини таъминлаш; </span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">эко-йўлаклар (экологик маршрутлар)ни ташкил этиш, уларни зарур инфратузилма (йўл кўрсаткичлар, дам олиш нуқталари, кузатув майдончалари, қўриқлаш постлари) билан жиҳозлаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ҳудудни комплекс ободонлаштириш, санитария-гигиена ҳолатини яхшилаш, кўкаламзорлаштириш ишларини кенгайтириш, шунингдек, дам олиш учун мўлжалланган ҳудудлар, санитария узеллари, чиқиндиларни йиғиш ва саралаш тизимларини амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бунда, юқорида назарда тутилаётган чора-тадбирларни амалга ошириш учун пудрат ташкилотларини электрон тендер («e-tender») платформаси орқали танлаб олиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">17.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Оҳангарон туманида жойлашган «Овжазсой-Мовий тоғлар» миллий табиат боғидан ташқаридаги ер участкаларида туристик хизматлар (биохилма-хилликка таъсир кўрсатмаган ҳолда глемпинг, кемпинг ва бошқа хизматлар) мақсадида «E-auksion» электрон савдо платформаси орқали белгиланган тартибда реализация қилиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил май — декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маҳаллий бюджет маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент вилояти ҳокимлиги манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар билан биргаликда</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">II. Ўрмонларни барпо этиш, қайта тиклаш, кенгайтириш, муҳофаза қилиш, қўриқлаш, ўрмондан қўшимча фойдаланиш</span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">18.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Илм-лойиҳа-амалиёт» занжирида замонавий кўчатхоналар ташкил этиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ниҳол етиштиришда интенсив усулга, кўчат етиштиришда ёпиқ илдизли тизимга босқичма-босқич тўлиқ ўтиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">хорижий инвесторлар ва тадбиркорлик субъектларини кенг жалб қилиш, кўчатхоналарни тўлиқ сув тежовчи тизимлар, иссиқхоналар ва «net house» усулидаги майдонлар билан жиҳозлаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">хорижий инвесторлар билан ҳамкорликда интенсив ниҳолхона ташкил этиш, «smart» иссиқхоналар ташкил этиш, махсус контейнерларда йирик ҳажмли манзарали кўчатларни етиштириш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">кўчатхоналарда ўрмон барпо этиш учун сувсизлик, қурғоқчилик ва шўрга чидамли, шу билан бирга тадбиркорлар ва аҳоли учун ноёб дарахт ва бута кўчатларини етиштириш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил куз мавсумидан бошлаб,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">доимий</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси, маҳаллий бюджет маблағлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">халқаро грантлар</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">19.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тоғ ўрмонларини кенгайтириш ва ер эрозиясига қарши курашиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Жаҳон банки маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Жиззах, Наманган, Қашқадарё, Самарқанд, Сирдарё, Сурхондарё вилоятлари ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">терраса усулида ўрмон барпо этиш учун ер участкаларини танлаш ва тайёрлаш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">тоғ олди ҳудудларда, жарлик ва қияликларда эрозиянинг олдини олиш мақсадида 2026 йилда 305 гектар майдонига 2028 йилгача босқичма-босқич дарахт ва бута кўчатларини экиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 — 2028 йиллар куз-қиш мавсумида</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">20.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Автомобиль йўллари ва темир йўллар атрофида «яшил белбоғ»лар барпо этиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари, қонунчиликда тақиқланмаган бошқа маблағлар</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Автомобиль йўллари қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Ўзбекистон темир йўллари» АЖ,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кадастр агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">йўл атрофидаги бўш ва кўкаламзорлаштириш мумкин бўлган </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ерларни</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> аниқлаш, аниқланган ер майдонлари учун харита ва кадастр ҳужжатларини тайёрлаш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил август</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«яшил белбоғ» лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатларини ишлаб чиқиш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатлари асосида «яшил белбоғ»лар барпо </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">этиш</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил баҳор мавсумида</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«яшил белбоғ» доирасида экилган дарахт ва буталарни </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">мунтазам</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> парвариш, зараркунандаларга қарши </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">курашиш</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> ва қуриган дарахтлар ўрнини ўз вақтида тўлдириш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">доимий</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">21.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Атроф-муҳитга таъсири бўйича I ва II тоифага кирувчи саноат корхоналари ва уларга туташ </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ҳудудларда</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> жами 10 миллион туп кўчатдан иборат «яшил белбоғ»лар барпо этиш. </span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">тупроқ-иқлим шароитига мос маҳаллий ва тез ўсувчи дарахт ҳамда бута кўчатларини экиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">суғориш ва парвариш ишларини самарали ташкил этиш учун замонавий томчилатиб суғориш ва сув тежовчи технологияларни жорий этиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026-2027 йиллар баҳор ва куз мавсумларида</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тадбиркорлик субъектлари маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">хўжалик бирлашмалари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">22.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Болгариянинг «S.E.E. Нolding Ltd.» — «Acta» компанияси билан ҳамкорликда 50 минг гектарда ўрмон барпо этиш ва 500 минг гектарда табиий тикланишга кўмаклашиш тадбирларининг дастлабки босқичини бошлаш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027-2028 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Инвестиция дастури асосида</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">23.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экологик тоза ва органик маҳсулотлар етиштиришни йўлга қўйиш учун агроўрмончилик лойиҳаларини амалга ошириш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">доривор, асал, резаворлар етиштиришга ихтисослашган ўрмон барпо этиш лойиҳаларини амалга ошириш; </span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«энергетик» ўрмонлар, яъни саноатбоп дарахтлар плантацияларини яратиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмон хўжаликларида органик ўғитлар захираларини яратиш, бунда биогумус ишлаб чиқаришни ташкил этиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">пистазорлар майдонини кенгайтириш, бунда эрта ҳосилга кирувчи серҳосил навларидан томчилатиб суғориш тизимини жорий қилган ҳолда плантациялар ташкил этиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмон фонди ерларида экотуризмни ривожлантириш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил 1 январдан бошлаб,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">доимий</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Жаҳон банки маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">24.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмонларни муҳофаза қилиш ва қўриқлаш тадбирларини кучайтириш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмонларнинг ёнғин хавфи мавжуд ҳудудларига ўрмон назорат миноралари ўрнатиш:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмонзорлар ва бутазорларда ёнғинга қарши «йўллар» (полоса) қуриш:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ёнғинлар, зараркунанда ва касалликларни аниқлаш, олдини олиш ва уларни бартараф этишда замонавий технологиялардан кенг фойдаланиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йилдан бошлаб, доимий</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси, маҳаллий бюджет, халқаро молия институтлари маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фавқулодда вазиятлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Республика ўрмонларини ҳимоя қилиш бўйича мавжуд норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжатларни такомиллаштириш бўйича таклиф ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">25.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йилда Навоий вилоятининг Конимех ва Томди ҳамда Тошкент вилоятининг Қуйи Чирчиқ, Оҳангарон, Паркент тумани «Саксонота» ва «Тошкент» давлат ўрмон хўжаликларида қуриб битказилган ва янгидан бошланган суғориш қудуқларини давлат рўйхатидан ўтказиш. </span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бир ой муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги соҳасида назорат қилиш инспекцияси</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">III. Чўлланишнинг олдини олиш ва унга қарши курашиш</span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">26.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Жаҳон банки ва халқаро экспертлар билан ҳамкорликда 2040 йилгача чўлланишга қарши курашиш стратегиясини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">қурғоқчилик таъсирини юмшатиш ва хавфини бошқариш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">эрта огоҳлантириш тизимини жорий этиш орқали қум-чанг бўронларини бошқариш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2 миллион гектар ерларда «яшил қоплама»лар барпо этиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">10 минг тонна чўл ўсимликларининг уруғларини тайёрлаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">30 миллион дона чўл ўсимликларининг ниҳол ва кўчатларини етиштириш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">шўр ва сувсизликка чидамли чўл ўсимликларидан галофит ва ксерофит боғларини ташкил этиш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Шунингдек, республикада чўлланиш билан боғлиқ барча масалаларни қамраб олиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">27.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўзбекистоннинг чўл ҳудудларидаги ўрмон фонди ерларини хатловдан ўтказиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">аэрокосмик суратлар ёрдамида ўрмон фонди ерларининг ортофотопланларини яратиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">табиий чўл-яйлов ва пичанзорларда геоботаник тадқиқотлар ўтказиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">чўлланган ва деградацияга учраган ерларнинг рақамли хариталарини ишлаб чиқиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">чўл ҳудудларида ўсимлик дунёси ареали, кўп йиллик озуқабоп ва дориворлик хусусиятларига эга ўсимликлар турлари аниқлаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмон чўл ерларини «UzKAD» электрон тизимига киритиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмон фонди ерларининг доимий мониторингини юритиш назарда тутилади.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кадастр агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Космик тадқиқотлар ва технологиялар агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши ва вилоятлар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">28.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тупроқ сифатини яхшилаш ва ер унумдорлигини ошириш мақсадида республика бўйича деградацияга учраган ва чўлланган ҳудудлар бўйича миллий баҳолаш мезонлари ҳамда кўрсаткичларини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси, манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">29.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Трансчегаравий қум-чанг бўронларини олдини олиш бўйича ягона концепция ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бунда давлатлараро музокаралар олиб бориш, институционал механизм, трансчегаравий қум-чанг бўронлари ҳосил бўладиган ҳудудларни аниқлаш ва хариталаш, илмий асосланган курашиш чоралари, чўл ўсимликлари уруғчилиги ва кўчатчилиги базаларини яратиш, «яшил қоплама»ларни барпо этишни жадаллаштириш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси, Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, Бухоро, Сурхондарё, Навоий, Хоразм вилоятлари ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">30.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Чўлланишга қарши курашиш ва чўл иқтисодиётини ривожлантириш бўйича Марказий Осиё минтақавий қўшма илмий-тадқиқот марказининг Хитой билан ҳамкорликни кучайтириш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қонунчиликда тақиқланмаган манбалар,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">халқаро грантлар</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Бир макон — бир йўл» ташаббуси доирасида чўл ҳудудларида яшил майдонларни кенгайтириш, илмий салоҳиятни ривожлантириш, тажрибалар алмашиш, марказ иштирокида конференция ва семинарлар ташкил этиш бўйича дастур лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш ҳамда босқичма-босқич амалга ошириш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил март</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Марказ кўмагида амалга ошириладиган ва Ўзбекистонда чўл ҳудудлари экотизимини яхшилашга қаратилган илмий-инновацион ва йирик лойиҳалар рўйхатини шакллантириш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">31.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Уруғларни капсула кўринишида қанотсизлантириб сепиш тизимини йўлга қўйиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси ва грант маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">чўл ўсимликлари уруғларини агропарвоз технологияси асосида экиш тизимини йўлга қўйиш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил ноябрь-декабрь,</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">уруғларни аниқ манзилларга учириб ташлаш орқали катта майдонларда тез ва самарали ўрмонларни тиклаш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2028 йил баҳор, куз-қиш мавсумида</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">32.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон хўжалиги илмий-тадқиқот институти олимлари томонидан «яшил қоплама»ларни яратишда сув сақловчи гидрогел қўллаш орқали чўл ва яйлов ўсимликлари кўкарувчанлигини ошириш бўйича бажарилган илмий лойиҳа натижаларини республикамизнинг бошқа чўл ҳудудларида (Бухоро, Навоий, Хоразм вилоятлари) қўллаш ҳамда синовдан ўтказиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026-2027 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Илмий ва амалий лойиҳалар доирасида</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бухоро, Навоий, Хоразм вилоятлари ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">33.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Франция тараққиёт агентлиги билан ҳамкорликда Қорақалпоғистон Республикасининг 9 та туманида кредит маблағлари ҳисобига деградацияга учраган ерларни тиклаш лойиҳасини амалга ошириш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маҳаллий бюджет, халқаро молия ташкилотлари маблағ ва грантлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">лойиҳа доирасида тадбирларни амалга ошириш бўйича техник-иқтисодий асосни ишлаб чиқишни якунлаш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">кўзда тутилган тадбирларни амалга ошириш, жумладан, 20 минг гектар «яшил белбоғ»лар тармоғини ташкил этиш, 6 минг гектарда агроўрмончиликни барпо этиш, 2 та тренинг марказини ташкил этиш, 6 минг нафар доимий ва мавсумий иш ўринларини яратиш лойиҳасини бошлаш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил апрель — декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">34.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Чўлланишга қарши курашиш конвенцияси томонлар конференциясининг 17-йиғилишида Ўзбекистон делегациясининг иштирок этишини таъминлаш. </span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил август</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Халқаро молия ташкилотлари маблағ ва грантлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Шунингдек, Чўлланишга қарши курашиш конвенцияси томонидан ташкил этилган «Марказий Осиё+Россия» давлатлараро ишчи гуруҳида «Глобал ер истиқболлари» лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027-2028 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">35.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қозоғистон Республикаси билан биргаликда Қорақалпоғистон Республикасида чўл ва яйлов озуқа ўсимликлари кўчатларини етиштириш бўйича минтақавий марказни ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил давомида</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ташқи ишлар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">IV. Мамлакатимизда яшиллик даражасини ошириш учун ирригация-дренаж тизимларининг барқарор ишлашини таъминлаш</span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">36.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Шаҳар ва туманлар кесимида «яшил» сув балансини шакллантириш ва мавжуд тармоқларни рақамлаштириш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">халқаро грантлар, қонунчиликда тақиқланмаган бошқа маблағлар</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тоғ-кон саноати ва геология вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Сув хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ҳар бир шаҳар ва туман кесимида ерости сувлари, сув омборлари, дарё ва каналлардан келадиган сув ҳажми, ёмғир сувлари, қайта ишланган оқова сувлардан яшилликка ажратиладиган қисмини аниқлаш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил август</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">мавжуд яшил майдонларнинг сувга бўлган эҳтиёжини (дарахтзор, боғлар, парклар) аниқ ҳисоблаш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">яшил ҳудудларнинг сув олиш нуқталари бўйича маълумотларни геоахборот тизимларининг (ирригация-дренаж тармоқлари, насос станциялари, сув тақсимлаш иншоотлари) GPS координаталари асосида рақамлаштириш ва Ситуацион марказ платформаларига интеграция қилиш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил март</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ҳар бир ҳудуд учун қурғоқчил ва ёғингарчилик йилларига ажратган ҳолда «Яшил» сув баланси паспортини шакллантириш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил август</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">37.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Аҳоли яшаш ҳудудларида экологик барқарорликни таъминлаш ва яшил макон улушини ошириш мақсадида халқаро экологик стандартлар (ISO 14001, ISO 37120 ва бошқалар) талабларига мувофиқ ландшафт ва кўкаламзорлаштириш ишларини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бунда яшил ҳудудлар таркибида маҳаллий иқлим ва тупроқ шароитига мос ўсимлик турларини жорий этиш, сув тежовчи ва қайта тикланадиган суғориш технологияларини қўллаш, биохилмахилликни сақлаш ҳамда аҳоли учун қулай экологик муҳит яратиш чоралари амалга оширилади.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ушбу жараёнда халқаро тажриба асосида яшил ҳудудларнинг экологик самарадорлик кўрсаткичлари баҳоланиб, миллий ва маҳаллий ривожланиш дастурларига интеграция қилинади.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">доимий</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Вазирлар Кенгаши,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">38.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ботаника ва дендрология йўналишида табиат боғлари билан талаба ва мактаб ўқувчиларини таништириш учун «<b>Smart флора»</b> дастурини ишлаб чиқиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ҳар бир ўсимлик ва дарахт турларини расми, барги орқали идентификация қилиш тизимини ташкил қилиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">QR паспорти (тури, ёши, геолокация, парвариш журнали)ни жорий этиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">дастурда ўсимлик ва дарахтларнинг касаллик турлари, уларни даволаш усуллари, суғориш меъёрлари ва зараркунандаларга қарши курашиш тадбирлари бўйича маълумотлар базасини шакллантириш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">маълумотлар базасини «yashilmakon.eco» платформаси билан интеграция қилиш орқали мониторинг тизимини ишлаб чиқиш. </span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026-2027 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси маблағлари, қонунчилик ҳужжатлари билан тақиқланмаган маблағлар</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Рақамли технологиялар вазирлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">39.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Таълим-илм-фан ва жамоат иштирокини институционаллаштириш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«яшил» техникумлар билан дуал таълим дастурини (амалий машғулотлар, стажировкалар, модул курсларини) яратиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғларидан мактаб ва техникум талабалари учун «Бир синф — бир дарахт» ёки «Талабалар боғи» майдонларини ажратиш ва унда экиладиган дарахт ва буталарни ўқувчи ва талабалар номига тамғалаш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">қизиқувчилар учун қисқа интерактив видеоматериаллар тайёрлаш ва боғларга киришда катта монитор орқали таништирув ташкил қилиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника боғларида экскурсия ва фестиваллар ташкил қилиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">маҳаллалардаги ёшлар етакчилари томонидан ҳар ойда камида бир марта ботаника ва дендрология боғларида экотадбирлар ташкил қилиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">оммавий ахборот воситалари томонидан ботаника ва дендрология боғлари фаолиятини оммага кенг ёритиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026-2027 ўқув йилидан бошлаб доимий</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Мактабгача ва мактаб таълими вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ёшлар ишлари агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">V. Республикада ўрмончилик соҳасида уруғчиликни ривожлантириш ҳамда доривор ўсимликлар турларини кенгайтириш</span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">40.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ноёб турдаги ўрмон ва доривор ўсимликларнинг ҳолатини ўрганиш, маданийлаштириш, уруғлик ҳамда генетик банкларини яратиш ва хариталаш йўналишларида тадқиқотлар олиб бориш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Йўқолиб кетиш хавфи остида бўлган ўрмон ва доривор ўсимликларнинг тури, таркибини аниқлаш ҳамда уларнинг тарқалиш ареалларини ўрганиш, хариталаш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ёввойи ҳолда ўсадиган ноёб доривор ўсимликлар биоэкологиясини ўрганиш ва уларни маданийлаштириш бўйича илмий асосланган таклифлар ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ноёб турдаги ўрмон ва доривор ўсимликларнинг генбанкини яратиш бўйича ҳамкорликда тадқиқотлар олиб бориш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026-2027 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Давлат бюджети маблағлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">халқаро грантлар</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">41.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Истиқболли доривор ўсимликларни «ин-витро» усулида кўпайтириш технологиясини ишлаб чиқиш ва жорий этиш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Истиқболли доривор ўсимликлар турларини жадал кўпайтириш бўйича илмий лойиҳа таклифларини ишлаб чиқиш ва амалга ошириш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Ин-витро» усулида кўпайтирилган истиқболли доривор ўсимликлардан маданий плантациялар барпо этиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026-2027 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Давлат бюджети маблағлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">халқаро грантлар</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">42.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон соҳасида уруғчиликни ривожлантириш:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмон уруғчилиги соҳасини ўрганиш ва таҳлил қилиш асосида муаммоларни аниқлаш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмон уруғчилиги соҳасини ривожлантириш чора-тадбирлари тўғрисида тегишли қарор лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиб, вазирлик ва идоралар билан келишиш;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt left 133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">қарор лойиҳасини Вазирлар Маҳкамасига киритиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt left 133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">43.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент ботаника боғига интродукция қилинган ноёб турдаги дарахт ва бута уруғчилик генофондини яратиш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ботаника боғида мавжуд ва интродукция қилинган ноёб турдаги манзарали, ўрмон дарахт-бута турлари уруғларини жамғариш, ниҳолларини етиштириш.</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Мазкур турларнинг кўчатларини ўрмон хўжаликларида экиш, кўпайтириш, кўчатчилигини йўлга қўйиш ва доимий уруғчилик майдонларини ташкил этиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026-2027 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Давлат бюджети маблағлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">халқаро грантлар</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:157.15pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">VI. Ҳудудларда ботаника ва дендрология боғларини ташкил қилиш</span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">44.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Лойиҳа ва пудрат ташкилотларини электрон тендер («e-tender» платформаси) савдоларида танлаб олиш орқали Андижон, Наманган, Фарғона вилоятлари ҳокимликлари захирасидаги ерлар майдонларида замонавий дендрология ва ботаника боғларини ташкил этиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 — 2028 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Андижон, Наманган ва Фарғона вилоятлари ҳокимликлари</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кадастр агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Андижон, Наманган ва Фарғона вилоятлари ҳокимликлари захирасидаги ер участкалари дендрология ва ботаника боғларини ташкил этиш мақсадида Экология қўмитаси тасарруфига ўтказилади ҳамда Кадастр агентлиги томонидан кадастр ҳужжатлари расмийлаштирилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">зарур ҳолларда ер тоифасини ўзгартириш бўйича Ҳукумат комиссиясига тегишли таклиф киритилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қонунчиликда белгиланган муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғларини ташкил этиш учун ажратилган ер майдонларининг йўл ва суғориш инфратузилмаси жойлашуви аниқланади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғларини ташкил этиш учун лойиҳаси-смета ҳужжатлари ишлаб чиқилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатларига асосан ботаника ва дендрология боғлари ташкил этилади.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2028 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">45.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Лойиҳа ва пудрат ташкилотларини электрон тендер («e-tender» платформаси) савдоларида танлаб олиш орқали Бухоро, Навоий, Сурхондарё ва Қашқадарё вилоятлари ҳокимликларининг захира ер майдонларида замонавий дендрология ва ботаника боғларини ташкил этиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 — 2028 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="6" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бухоро, Навоий, Сурхондарё, ва Қашқадарё вилоятлари ҳокимликлари</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кадастр агентлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бухоро, Навоий, Сурхондарё ва Қашқадарё вилоятлари ҳокимликлари захирасидаги ер участкалари дендрология ва ботаника боғларини ташкил этиш мақсадида Экология қўмитаси тасарруфига ўтказилади ҳамда Кадастр агентлиги томонидан кадастр ҳужжатлари расмийлаштирилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил октябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">зарур ҳолларда ер тоифасини ўзгартириш бўйича Ҳукумат комиссиясига тегишли таклиф киритилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қонунчиликда белгиланган муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғини ташкил этиш учун ажратилган ер майдонларининг йўл ва суғориш инфратузилмаси жойлашуви аниқланади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғларини ташкил этиш учун лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатлари ишлаб чиқилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатларига асосан ботаника ва дендрология боғлари ташкил этилади.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2028 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">46.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Лойиҳа ва пудрат ташкилотларини электрон тендер («e-tender» платформаси) савдоларида танлаб олиш орқали Жиззах, Сирдарё ва Самарқанд вилоятлари ҳокимликлари захирасидаги ер майдонларида замонавий дендрология ва ботаника боғларини ташкил этиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027-2028 йилларда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Жиззах, Сирдарё, ва Самарқанд вилоятлари ҳокимликлари</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кадастр агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Жиззах, Сирдарё ва Самарқанд вилоятлари ҳокимликлари захирасидаги ер участкалари дендрология ва ботаника боғларини ташкил этиш мақсадида Экология қўмитаси тасарруфига ўтказилади ҳамда Кадастр агентлиги томонидан кадастр ҳужжатлари расмийлаштирилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил январь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">зарур ҳолларда ер тоифасини ўзгартириш бўйича Ҳукумат комиссиясига тегишли таклиф киритилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қонунчиликда белгиланган муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғини ташкил этиш учун ажратилган ер майдонларининг йўл ва суғориш инфратузилмаси жойлашуви аниқланади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2028 йил март</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғларини ташкил этиш учун лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатлари ишлаб чиқилади;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатларига асосан ботаника ва дендрология боғлари ташкил этилади.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2028 йил сентябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">47.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Лойиҳа ва пудрат ташкилотларини электрон тендер («e-tender» платформаси) савдоларида танлаб олиш орқали Тошкент ва Хоразм вилоятлари ҳокимликлари, Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Жўқорғи Кенгеси захирасидаги ер майдонларида замонавий дендрология ва ботаника боғларини ташкил этиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027-2028 йиллар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент ва Хоразм вилоятлари ҳокимликлари,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кадастр агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент ва Хоразм вилоятлари ҳокимликлари, Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Жўқорғи Кенгеси захирасидаги ер участкалари дендрология ва ботаника боғларини ташкил этиш мақсадида Экология қўмитаси тасарруфига ўтказилади ҳамда Кадастр агентлиги томонидан кадастр ҳужжатлари расмийлаштирилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил июнь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">зарур ҳолларда ер тоифасини ўзгартириш бўйича Ҳукумат комиссиясига тегишли таклиф киритилади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қонунчиликда белгиланган муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғини ташкил этиш учун ажратилган ер майдонларининг йўл ва суғориш инфратузилмаси жойлашуви аниқланади;</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2027 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ботаника ва дендрология боғларини ташкил этиш учун лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатлари ишлаб чиқилади;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:17.1pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">лойиҳа-смета ҳужжатларига асосан ботаника ва дендрология боғлари ташкил этилади.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:12%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:133.9pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2028 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="PUBLICATION_ORIGIN"><label id="s1089"></label><div name="8102950" id="8102950">(Қонунчилик маълумотлари миллий базаси, 30.03.2026 й., 06/26/47/0291-сон; 06.07.2026 й., 06/26/123/0692-сон)</div></div></div>
</div></body></html>